    "note": "So the cabinet stood, and stands: Monday, the Lead-white (Saturn); Tuesday, the Amber (Sun); Wednesday, the Bone (Mercury); Thursday, the Verdigris (Venus); Friday, the Ochre (Jupiter); Saturday, the Ultramarine (Moon); Sunday, the Crimson (Mars). And Saturday's drawer held the Ultramarine — silver, Moon's metal. The cabinet keeps its own order; the almanac may see to its own."
